 "message": "I can't file a production database access request for Ethan Brooks (E013). He is an Engineering Intern, and POL-ACC-02 says production database access is for full-time Engineering staff only, and that interns are never eligible for elevated or restricted systems. The helpdesk cannot make exceptions or forward exception requests. Under POL-ACC-02, an exception needs the employee's department head to email Security directly.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
